WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse.

4
01:34.759 --> 01:35.800
Don't worry about having no answers.

5
01:35.800 --> 01:37.160
Worry about it not being difficult.

6
01:37.160 --> 01:38.240
As long as you dare to ask,

7
01:38.240 --> 01:40.000
Lawyer Qiu will give you the answer.

8
01:40.000 --> 01:41.600
The trial today is a big case.

9
01:41.600 --> 01:44.479
But I, Lawyer Qiu, am already well-prepared.

10
01:45.240 --> 01:46.170
Shooting a skit?

11
01:47.920 --> 01:48.600
Colleague.

12
01:51.680 --> 01:54.120
Lawyer Qiu has such a strong sense of belief.

13
01:54.120 --> 01:55.000
What is this?

14
01:55.160 --> 01:56.120
Artist.

15
01:56.120 --> 01:57.759
A born performing artist.

16
02:01.800 --> 02:03.040
It's up to you now.

17
02:03.520 --> 02:04.120
Good luck.

18
02:04.640 --> 02:06.970
Thanks for your cooperation, Lawyer Qiu.

19
02:18.400 --> 02:20.260
The victim's family is also here.

20
02:22.280 --> 02:23.680
This is going to be tough.

21
02:24.600 --> 02:25.880
Good luck, Lawyer Li.

22
02:39.200 --> 02:40.760
The court is now in session.

23
02:40.840 --> 02:43.480
Summon Shao Yinhai, Ma Benteng, and

24
02:43.480 --> 02:45.760
the other five defendants to the court.

25
03:04.000 --> 03:07.120
The defense will now present evidence to the court.

26
03:10.840 --> 03:13.200
Regarding the crime of illegal detention.

27
03:13.200 --> 03:15.040
The detainee claimed

28
03:15.120 --> 03:16.840
to have been held by Shao Yinhai's subordinates

29
03:16.840 --> 03:19.400
in an agricultural warehouse in the northern suburbs

30
03:19.400 --> 03:20.760
for up to six hours.

31
03:21.000 --> 03:23.640
However, the city's ring road was not yet open at that time.

32
03:23.640 --> 03:25.920
The journey from the crime scene to the hospital

33
03:25.920 --> 03:28.840
would take at least four and a half hours by car.

34
03:28.920 --> 03:30.040
Therefore, we can infer

35
03:30.040 --> 03:32.200
that the so-called illegal detention time

36
03:32.200 --> 03:34.200
was even less than two hours.

37
03:35.840 --> 03:37.120
Regarding the accusation against Shao Yinhai

38
03:37.120 --> 03:38.800
for the crime of illegally occupying agricultural land,

39
03:38.800 --> 03:40.680
the appraisal report submitted by the prosecution

40
03:40.680 --> 03:42.360
has major flaws.

41
03:42.720 --> 03:44.840
It only lists the data after the forest land was damaged,

42
03:44.840 --> 03:46.900
but lacks the data before the damage.

43
03:47.120 --> 03:49.520
And on page 31 of the appraisal report,

44
03:49.520 --> 03:52.280
The same sub-compartment of forest land at the same coordinates

45
03:52.280 --> 03:53.940
was simultaneously marked as

46
03:54.000 --> 03:56.120
both a state-owned forest farm and collective forest land.

47
03:56.120 --> 03:56.840
In summary,

48
03:57.120 --> 04:01.250
this appraisal report is insufficient to serve as a basis for the verdict.

49
04:01.600 --> 04:03.440
Regarding the crime of intentional destruction of property,

50
04:03.440 --> 04:04.360
this is a 2008 directive document

51
04:04.360 --> 04:06.560
from the Feng'an Provincial Public Security Department.

52
04:06.560 --> 04:07.840
The document states that

53
04:07.840 --> 04:10.120
developing iron ore is a local policy.

54
04:10.240 --> 04:11.560
For production safety,

55
04:11.560 --> 04:14.680
each mining area must establish its own mine protection team.

56
04:14.680 --> 04:17.800
The victim, Chen, entered the mining area to commit theft

57
04:17.800 --> 04:20.600
and attempted to flee in a vehicle after being discovered.

58
04:20.600 --> 04:23.880
To ensure the property safety of the mining area,

59
04:24.120 --> 04:26.040
the mine protection team damaged his vehicle.

60
04:26.040 --> 04:28.800
The defense argues that this action was a performance of duty,

61
04:28.800 --> 04:31.200
not intentional destruction of property.

62
04:31.280 --> 04:31.960
Ma Benteng,

63
04:32.800 --> 04:33.720
your confession states that

64
04:33.720 --> 04:35.880
you were instructed by Shao Yinhai that day.

65
04:35.880 --> 04:37.880
and beat the victim to death, right?

66
04:38.120 --> 04:38.600
Yes.

67
04:39.120 --> 04:41.840
I called Chairman Shao for instructions before I did it.

68
04:41.840 --> 04:42.700
Specific time?

69
04:43.280 --> 04:45.480
Around 2:00 or 3:00.

70
04:45.920 --> 04:48.000
According to the carrier's call records,

71
04:48.000 --> 04:50.840
you only had one call with Shao Yinhai that day.

72
04:50.840 --> 04:53.000
The time of the call was

73
04:53.000 --> 04:54.440
2:58 PM.

74
04:54.440 --> 04:56.120
And the surveillance video at the scene shows

75
04:56.120 --> 04:57.680
the time you beat him was

76
04:57.840 --> 04:59.600
3:12 PM.

77
05:03.000 --> 05:04.400
Judging from the time on the surveillance video,

78
05:04.400 --> 05:05.120
You did indeed

79
05:05.120 --> 05:07.120
talk to Shao Yinhai on the phone

80
05:07.200 --> 05:08.960
before beating the victim.

81
05:09.440 --> 05:11.840
But what if the time on the video is wrong?

82
05:15.240 --> 05:16.080
Your Honor,

83
05:16.160 --> 05:19.080
we have obtained the complete surveillance video record.

84
05:19.080 --> 05:20.740
The surveillance video shows

85
05:20.800 --> 05:22.280
that the sunset time on that day was

86
05:22.280 --> 05:23.720
19:25.

87
05:23.800 --> 05:27.000
But we compared it with the Meteorological Bureau's records for that day.

88
05:27.000 --> 05:29.400
The actual sunset time on that day was

89
05:29.400 --> 05:30.880
18:25.

90
05:30.880 --> 05:31.880
In other words,

91
05:32.159 --> 05:34.560
the time on the video is

92
05:34.600 --> 05:36.960
actually one hour later than the real time.

93
05:36.960 --> 05:38.090
But unfortunately,

94
05:38.760 --> 05:40.680
the prosecution failed to notice this error

95
05:40.680 --> 05:44.120
and wrongly accepted Ma Benteng's statement.

96
05:44.480 --> 05:46.560
So, counting backward from the exact time of sunset,

97
05:46.560 --> 05:48.720
the actual time Ma Benteng committed the assault was

98
05:48.720 --> 05:50.360
14:12,

99
05:50.560 --> 05:52.320
which was before his phone call with Shao Yinhai

100
05:52.320 --> 05:54.560
at 14:58.

101
05:54.560 --> 05:55.880
Then I would like to ask,

102
05:55.880 --> 05:58.680
how could my client have instigated the crime

103
05:58.680 --> 06:00.880
after it had already happened?

104
06:01.080 --> 06:01.840
Objection.

105
06:02.400 --> 06:04.280
Based on other evidence in the case,

106
06:04.280 --> 06:06.740
Ma Benteng had no grudge against the victim.

107
06:06.760 --> 06:08.200
If it weren't for Shao Yinhai,

108
06:08.200 --> 06:10.080
he wouldn't even have a motive for the assault.

109
06:10.080 --> 06:11.280
As Shao Yinhai's subordinate,

110
06:11.280 --> 06:13.840
receiving a salary far beyond normal,

111
06:13.840 --> 06:17.080
he should have understood why he was hired at such a high price.

112
06:17.080 --> 06:18.640
So he unscrupulously

113
06:18.640 --> 06:21.200
helped Shao Yinhai settle various problems encountered

114
06:21.200 --> 06:22.520
during the company's expansion.

115
06:22.520 --> 06:23.640
His violent behavior

116
06:23.640 --> 06:26.320
was in fact a manifestation of Shao Yinhai's will.

117
06:26.320 --> 06:27.600
In judicial practice,

118
06:28.080 --> 06:30.880
instigation must be supported by clear evidence.

119
06:31.280 --> 06:32.760
Those so-called facts without evidence

120
06:32.760 --> 06:35.400
and unverified by the judiciary

121
06:35.440 --> 06:36.840
are merely assumptions

122
06:36.960 --> 06:39.520
and should not be the basis for judging a case.

123
06:39.960 --> 06:40.840
Legally,

124
06:40.920 --> 06:42.400
facts without evidence

125
06:42.840 --> 06:44.570
are considered non-existent.

126
06:44.840 --> 06:46.840
But the provable fact is that

127
06:46.840 --> 06:48.300
on the day of the incident,

128
06:48.400 --> 06:50.280
Shao Yinhai, as the opening guest

129
06:50.280 --> 06:51.640
of Leyang's most important

130
06:51.640 --> 06:53.600
business conference that year,

131
06:53.640 --> 06:55.280
gave a speech on stage

132
06:55.280 --> 06:57.520
for half an hour.

133
06:57.520 --> 06:59.720
He had absolutely no time to give orders.

134
06:59.720 --> 07:03.200
Since then, the projects he undertook have contributed

135
07:03.200 --> 07:06.080
3.562 billion in taxes to the country.

136
07:06.240 --> 07:07.800
And the jobs he provided

137
07:07.960 --> 07:10.760
supported 8,764 families.

138
07:12.160 --> 07:14.600
Honorable Chief Judge and collegial panel,

139
07:14.600 --> 07:17.160
my client should indeed,

140
07:17.720 --> 07:20.360
for the illegal acts during the company's development,

141
07:20.360 --> 07:21.800
bear criminal responsibility

142
07:21.800 --> 07:23.360
and provide due compensation.

143
07:23.360 --> 07:25.160
But his contribution to society

144
07:25.720 --> 07:27.380
should not be ignored either.

145
07:27.520 --> 07:30.650
So please take this into comprehensive consideration.

146
07:32.800 --> 07:35.000
Regarding the eight charges brought by the prosecution,

147
07:35.000 --> 07:37.200
we have no objection to the charges of picking quarrels and provoking trouble,

148
07:37.200 --> 07:40.960
falsely issuing invoices, and illegal business operations.

149
07:41.400 --> 07:43.520
The defendant pleads guilty and accepts the punishment.

150
07:43.520 --> 07:44.520
The prosecution's charge of

151
07:44.520 --> 07:47.040
illegal detention is unfounded.

152
07:47.280 --> 07:49.960
The charges of intentional injury, intentional destruction of property,

153
07:49.960 --> 07:51.520
illegal occupation of agricultural land,

154
07:51.520 --> 07:52.200
and organizing and leading

155
07:52.200 --> 07:54.080
a mafia-style organization

156
07:54.280 --> 07:55.140
are unfounded.

157
08:12.240 --> 08:13.040
Lawyer Li.

158
08:15.360 --> 08:16.160
Your defense statement

159
08:16.160 --> 08:18.240
sounds like what I said to Director Shao.

160
08:18.240 --> 08:19.040
Yes.

161
08:20.280 --> 08:21.520
The first time you said it,

162
08:21.520 --> 08:23.250
I thought it made a lot of sense.

163
08:24.280 --> 08:25.810
Pleasure working with you.

164
08:33.600 --> 08:36.200
Lawyer Li, that speech just now was brilliant.

165
08:36.840 --> 08:37.770
Scumbag lawyer!

166
08:38.159 --> 08:39.240
Helping the wicked!

167
08:39.240 --> 08:41.159
You have no morals! How can you be a lawyer?

168
08:41.159 --> 08:42.120
I'm telling you, that's enough.

169
08:42.120 --> 08:42.919
Do you even deserve to be a lawyer?

170
08:42.919 --> 08:44.600
This is picking quarrels and provoking trouble, plus defamation.

171
08:44.600 --> 08:46.040
I can hold you legally responsible.

172
08:46.040 --> 08:47.000
Hold who responsible?

173
08:47.000 --> 08:47.840
We lost a family member.

174
08:47.840 --> 08:48.400
It's a human life!

175
08:48.400 --> 08:49.800
Fine, I'm calling the police right now.

176
08:49.800 --> 08:50.120
Wait.

177
08:50.120 --> 08:50.800
Bowen.

178
08:50.800 --> 08:51.480
Forget it.

179
08:53.000 --> 08:53.800
Are you satisfied?

180
08:53.800 --> 08:54.840
Satisfied? Satisfied with what?

181
08:54.840 --> 08:57.640
A life is gone, what's there to be satisfied about?

182
08:59.840 --> 09:00.900
You have no morals!

183
09:00.920 --> 09:02.160
You don't deserve to be a lawyer.

184
09:02.160 --> 09:03.480
You don't deserve to be a lawyer.

185
09:03.480 --> 09:04.720
Have you no shame?

186
09:05.040 --> 09:06.120
Have you no shame?

187
09:06.360 --> 09:07.420
You have no morals!

188
09:08.560 --> 09:10.720
You don't deserve to be a lawyer!

189
09:13.880 --> 09:15.600
They are all so unreasonable.

190
09:15.600 --> 09:17.260
We didn't do those bad things.

191
09:17.960 --> 09:21.160
Witness, please state the facts of the case

192
09:21.280 --> 09:22.240
as you know them.

193
09:24.440 --> 09:25.280
At that time,

194
09:25.600 --> 09:29.060
the head office had just been sealed off and things were a mess.

195
09:29.840 --> 09:31.360
Zhou Huan instructed me

196
09:31.560 --> 09:33.560
to transfer the 1.2 million in wealth management funds

197
09:33.560 --> 09:35.800
all to my personal account.

198
09:36.720 --> 09:38.120
I was against it at first.

199
09:38.800 --> 09:41.400
But Zhou Huan kept coaxing me with sweet words,

200
09:42.120 --> 09:43.650
saying how much he loved me,

201
09:44.040 --> 09:46.170
and that he would definitely marry me.

202
09:46.800 --> 09:47.800
He also said

203
09:48.920 --> 09:51.920
that this type of crime wouldn't be punished heavily,

204
09:52.240 --> 09:55.040
and you'd usually be out after two years in prison.

205
09:55.240 --> 09:57.040
Once we got through this period,

206
09:58.040 --> 10:00.400
we would definitely live a happy life.

207
10:01.240 --> 10:02.320
I believed him.

208
10:02.960 --> 10:05.360
So I took all the blame for him.

209
10:07.920 --> 10:08.200
Presiding Judge.

210
10:08.200 --> 10:09.360
All rise.

211
10:09.360 --> 10:10.360
Presiding Judge.

212
10:12.400 --> 10:13.400
Presiding Judge.

213
10:13.600 --> 10:16.560
According to the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China,

214
10:16.560 --> 10:18.120
Article 176

215
10:18.360 --> 10:20.120
and Article 272,

216
10:20.120 --> 10:22.240
the judgment of this case is as follows:

217
10:22.240 --> 10:23.360
The defendant, Zhou Huan,

218
10:23.360 --> 10:26.000
is guilty of illegally absorbing public deposits

219
10:26.000 --> 10:27.240
and misappropriating funds.

220
10:27.240 --> 10:28.600
For these combined offenses,

221
10:28.600 --> 10:31.000
he is sentenced to six years in prison

222
10:31.240 --> 10:33.840
and fined 200,000 RMB.

223
10:34.480 --> 10:37.610
The trial of this case is concluded. Court is adjourned.

224
10:46.480 --> 10:48.440
The announcement about Jia Xin's fraud case

225
10:48.440 --> 10:49.440
is out, isn't it?

226
10:49.440 --> 10:51.080
Didn't it say the losses could be refunded?

227
10:51.080 --> 10:51.720
Indeed.

228
10:51.880 --> 10:54.200
After Jia Xin's assets were seized and liquidated,

229
10:54.200 --> 10:55.760
it is indeed possible to proportionally

230
10:55.760 --> 10:57.480
refund 90% to the public.

231
10:58.360 --> 10:59.760
Didn't you lose 180,000?

232
10:59.880 --> 11:01.080
You can get 162,000 back.

233
11:01.080 --> 11:03.240
Then I just threw away 28,000 for nothing?

234
11:03.240 --> 11:04.200
Who taught you math?

235
11:04.200 --> 11:05.080
It's 18,000.

236
11:05.960 --> 11:07.080
Isn't 18,000 still money?

237
11:07.080 --> 11:09.240
18,000 is enough to renovate my storefront.

238
11:09.240 --> 11:09.840
Then,

239
11:10.080 --> 11:11.840
what about the 200,000 my mom was scammed out of before?

240
11:11.840 --> 11:13.600
That belongs to another case.

241
11:13.600 --> 11:15.720
It cannot be merged and handled together with this case.

242
11:15.720 --> 11:16.080
True,

243
11:16.120 --> 11:17.480
they are two cases,

244
11:17.480 --> 11:19.440
but isn't the criminal the same person?

245
11:19.440 --> 11:21.000
Mr. Dong, please calm down first.

246
11:21.000 --> 11:22.440
The situation is like this.

247
11:22.440 --> 11:24.240
All of Jia Xin's illegal income,

248
11:24.520 --> 11:25.650
minus what he spent,

249
11:25.840 --> 11:27.320
has already been used to repay

250
11:27.320 --> 11:28.640
the victims of the financial fraud.

251
11:28.640 --> 11:30.700
Currently, it's only enough for 90%.

252
11:33.120 --> 11:34.000
What does that mean?

253
11:34.000 --> 11:35.240
So if I sue him now,

254
11:35.240 --> 11:36.840
I won't be able to get this money back, right?

255
11:36.840 --> 11:38.480
Theoretically, yes.

256
11:39.600 --> 11:41.440
Then I reported him for nothing.

257
11:41.440 --> 11:43.480
And I even offended a bunch of gangsters.

258
11:43.480 --> 11:45.210
Given your merit in reporting,

259
11:45.520 --> 11:46.920
we will give you a reward.

260
11:47.600 --> 11:50.240
See, I knew you wouldn't let me report for nothing.

261
11:50.240 --> 11:52.120
Alright, what's the reward?

262
11:53.800 --> 11:54.000
Min

263
11:54.800 --> 11:55.000
Shi

264
11:55.080 --> 11:55.320
Yang

265
11:55.320 --> 11:55.640
Le

266
11:57.640 --> 11:59.120
Definitely.

267
11:59.360 --> 12:00.820
You must trust the police.

268
12:03.080 --> 12:05.080
Isn't this the young man who helped us?

269
12:05.080 --> 12:05.840
It's you.

270
12:06.720 --> 12:07.440
It's him.

271
12:08.640 --> 12:09.640
It's my duty.

272
12:09.640 --> 12:10.280
Thank you.

273
12:10.280 --> 12:11.120
It's only right.

274
12:11.120 --> 12:12.840
It's only right. It's only right.

275
12:12.840 --> 12:14.000
Let's take a picture. It's only right.

276
12:14.000 --> 12:14.840
Let's take a picture.

277
12:14.840 --> 12:15.640
Thank you.

278
12:16.520 --> 12:17.520
No need. Don't.

279
12:17.520 --> 12:18.850
Don't push. Don't push.

280
12:19.120 --> 12:20.080
Okay, okay.

281
12:20.080 --> 12:21.000
Smile. Yeah.

282
12:30.360 --> 12:31.240
Lawyer Xiao.

283
12:31.640 --> 12:32.640
Knowing the regulations

284
12:32.640 --> 12:34.720
of the detention center,

285
12:34.840 --> 12:37.840
you intentionally played a recording to the detained client.

286
12:37.840 --> 12:38.720
We hope you

287
12:38.720 --> 12:41.440
can explain this violation.

288
12:43.480 --> 12:44.320
I'm sorry.

289
12:45.000 --> 12:47.530
I did violate the code of conduct for lawyers.

290
12:48.360 --> 12:51.360
I am willing to accept the corresponding punishment.

291
12:52.240 --> 12:54.100
President, what is your opinion?

292
12:58.880 --> 13:01.640
I think the punishment for Lawyer Xiao

293
13:02.480 --> 13:05.440
should consider both the hard rules of the industry

294
13:06.240 --> 13:07.480
and the essential requirement

295
13:07.480 --> 13:09.600
of practicing law,

296
13:10.000 --> 13:13.240
which is to do one's best for the client.

297
13:14.000 --> 13:14.640
I suggest

298
13:14.840 --> 13:17.770
we follow the Justice Bureau's suspension penalty.

299
13:17.840 --> 13:22.100
At its discretion, the Bar Association will not impose further punishment.

300
13:22.120 --> 13:23.080
Master.

301
13:26.000 --> 13:26.480
Master.

302
13:29.360 --> 13:32.200
Thank you for speaking up for me just now.

303
13:32.560 --> 13:35.320
It's been a long time since I heard you call me Master.

304
13:35.320 --> 13:38.480
You've always been my Master in my heart.

305
13:39.880 --> 13:42.540
Have you had enough of messing around out there?

306
13:43.880 --> 13:46.080
Come back when your suspension is over.

307
13:47.000 --> 13:47.600
Master.

308
13:49.000 --> 13:50.080
I heard you say

309
13:51.120 --> 13:54.960
that you used to work hard on your own

310
13:55.360 --> 13:57.690
and built everything up little by little.

311
13:58.360 --> 14:00.480
So I want to keep trying

312
14:00.840 --> 14:02.600
and see if I can make it.

313
14:05.200 --> 14:06.000
I understand.

314
14:07.480 --> 14:09.410
Everyone has their own ambitions.

315
14:09.600 --> 14:13.080
I hope you won't regret your choice today.

316
14:17.600 --> 14:18.660
Take care, Master.

317
14:34.400 --> 14:35.400
Sister.

318
14:35.800 --> 14:37.280
We've been suspended for so long.

319
14:37.280 --> 14:39.000
Our funds are running out.

320
14:39.000 --> 14:40.720
We are not RISING JUSTICE at all.

321
14:40.720 --> 14:42.800
We are going downhill.

322
14:48.080 --> 14:48.810
Sister Wang.

323
14:49.200 --> 14:49.800
Lawyer Xiao.

324
14:49.800 --> 14:51.560
I went back to Tieling a few days ago.

325
14:51.560 --> 14:52.560
I saw Wu Lian.

326
14:52.680 --> 14:54.740
She told me to give this letter to you.

327
14:55.480 --> 14:56.210
Sister Lian.

328
14:56.240 --> 14:56.520
Yes.

329
14:56.640 --> 14:57.880
Lawyer Xiao, I have things to do.

330
14:57.880 --> 14:59.400
I have to go to work. I'll leave now.

331
14:59.400 --> 15:00.280
Goodbye, Lawyer Xiao.

332
15:00.280 --> 15:00.880
Okay, take care.

333
15:00.880 --> 15:02.240
Goodbye. Thanks for your trouble.

334
15:02.240 --> 15:02.960
Take care.

335
15:03.720 --> 15:04.960
Written by Sister Lian.

336
15:04.960 --> 15:06.520
Quick, take a look.

337
15:22.000 --> 15:23.760
Apples, 10 yuan.

338
15:23.960 --> 15:25.240
Bread, 3 yuan.

339
15:25.600 --> 15:27.360
Toothpaste

340
15:27.360 --> 15:28.720
and toothbrush,

341
15:28.760 --> 15:30.000
14.8 yuan.

342
15:30.320 --> 15:32.960
Kettle, 26.9 yuan.

343
15:33.200 --> 15:35.680
Medical bill, 47.2 yuan.

344
15:35.720 --> 15:37.320
Filing a case, 10 yuan.

345
15:38.000 --> 15:39.600
Lollipop, 0.5 yuan.

346
15:45.120 --> 15:46.200
Helping me,

347
15:49.000 --> 15:49.760
priceless.

348
16:16.720 --> 16:18.480
This includes, but is not limited to...

349
16:18.480 --> 16:21.160
And this arbitration clause must be strictly controlled.

350
16:21.160 --> 16:22.480
Then I will follow your ideas

351
16:22.480 --> 16:23.940
and come up with a new plan.

352
16:25.200 --> 16:25.720
Come in.

353
16:26.440 --> 16:28.840
Boss, Shao Yinhai's verdict is out.

354
16:29.600 --> 16:31.240
All the gang-related charges were dropped.

355
16:31.240 --> 16:32.640
In the end, he was sentenced for illegal business operations,

356
16:32.640 --> 16:34.480
falsely issuing invoices, and picking quarrels and provoking trouble.

357
16:34.480 --> 16:35.640
Due to his good attitude in pleading guilty,

358
16:35.640 --> 16:37.200
he received a lighter sentence of six years and six months.

359
16:37.200 --> 16:39.320
The financial penalty totals 2.5 million.

360
16:39.320 --> 16:40.650
This is the best result.

361
16:41.080 --> 16:41.810
Attorney Li.

362
16:41.840 --> 16:42.840
Shanyuan and Baisi

363
16:42.840 --> 16:44.680
want to schedule a meeting with us as soon as possible to come up with a plan.

364
16:44.680 --> 16:46.440
Boss, you were really amazing this time,

365
16:46.440 --> 16:47.570
turning the tables.

366
16:48.120 --> 16:49.440
Everyone did a good job this time.

367
16:49.440 --> 16:51.640
Feel free to ask for any reward you want.

368
16:51.840 --> 16:53.370
What are you talking about?

369
16:53.720 --> 16:54.840
Being able to learn from you

370
16:54.840 --> 16:56.720
is the best reward for me.

371
16:57.600 --> 16:59.440
So we are not just pretty faces anymore?

372
16:59.440 --> 17:01.440
We are golden jade pillows.

373
17:02.000 --> 17:04.260
Now you're bringing up cultural relics.

374
17:04.319 --> 17:07.839
Boss, can I get a bonus?

375
17:07.880 --> 17:08.839
Of course.

376
17:08.920 --> 17:09.640
Same here.

377
17:09.640 --> 17:10.440
No problem.

378
17:12.240 --> 17:13.720
Well, what about me?

379
17:13.720 --> 17:15.380
You continue to learn from me.

380
17:17.920 --> 17:21.000
Not muting your phone at work will cost you your bonus.

381
17:21.000 --> 17:22.260
I forgot to turn it off.

382
17:22.720 --> 17:24.319
How did I end up losing money?

383
17:28.280 --> 17:29.280
Did you guys hear?

384
17:29.480 --> 17:31.010
Xiao Longnv got suspended.

385
18:02.320 --> 18:02.760
Take care.

386
18:02.760 --> 18:03.440
Bye.

387
18:04.320 --> 18:04.960
I'm off.

388
18:06.960 --> 18:07.890
Taking a shower?

389
18:09.360 --> 18:10.600
I'll take a bottle of water. Put it on my tab.

390
18:10.600 --> 18:11.240
Okay.

391
18:11.480 --> 18:12.680
You're here, Xiaoxu.

392
18:51.000 --> 18:51.930
So pretentious.

393
19:15.960 --> 19:16.880
Xiaoxin,

394
19:17.480 --> 19:19.240
come to my house for dinner tomorrow.

395
19:19.240 --> 19:21.640
I have something to tell you. You must come.

396
19:23.080 --> 19:25.340
You three go ahead and eat. I'm not going.

397
19:25.680 --> 19:27.520
Come on, why are you being so unreasonable?

398
19:27.520 --> 19:29.000
I've already made plans with the two kids.

399
19:29.000 --> 19:29.960
And the verdict is out.

400
19:29.960 --> 19:31.490
I think the verdict is fair.

401
19:31.720 --> 19:33.250
Now you understand the law?

402
19:33.360 --> 19:35.960
Do you think I studied at Beichuan University for nothing?

403
19:35.960 --> 19:36.720
The most important thing now is

404
19:36.720 --> 19:38.240
for the two kids to make up.

405
19:38.960 --> 19:40.560
And when they argued in the past,

406
19:40.560 --> 19:41.680
they'd be fine in two weeks at most.

407
19:41.680 --> 19:44.540
But it's been a while this time. Aren't you worried?

408
19:44.720 --> 19:45.780
Alright, alright.

409
19:46.520 --> 19:47.040
I'll put up with it.

410
19:47.040 --> 19:48.520
Yes, yes, you have to.

411
19:49.000 --> 19:50.000
As long as they make up,

412
19:50.000 --> 19:51.960
it also gives you a way out. Isn't that great?

413
19:51.960 --> 19:53.160
I don't need a way out.

414
19:53.160 --> 19:54.240
Right, you don't need it, you don't need it.

415
19:54.240 --> 19:56.760
You're so stubborn. Come, come, come.

416
19:59.360 --> 20:01.160
I'm just playing along with you.

417
20:01.560 --> 20:03.490
They're here, they're here. Come.

418
20:04.120 --> 20:05.050
Come, Xin, come.

419
20:05.240 --> 20:06.720
Come in, come in. I'll put it here, Uncle.

420
20:06.720 --> 20:08.040
Why did you buy these?

421
20:08.680 --> 20:09.940
We have plenty at home.

422
20:10.440 --> 20:11.720
No need to change shoes. No need to change.

423
20:11.720 --> 20:13.120
Let him change his shoes.

424
20:16.920 --> 20:18.650
You're quite observant today.

425
20:56.040 --> 20:58.240
Hurry up. There's treasure inside.

426
21:04.680 --> 21:06.240
There's a big sword over there.

427
21:06.240 --> 21:07.700
Can you help me get it down?

428
21:11.240 --> 21:12.240
A bit to the right.

429
21:12.560 --> 21:13.560
More to the right.

430
21:14.120 --> 21:15.240
Did you get it?

431
21:15.320 --> 21:16.680
Got it.

432
21:20.480 --> 21:21.760
Dad, I'm home.

433
21:25.400 --> 21:26.480
Why are you here?

434
21:27.720 --> 21:29.240
Xin is my guest.

435
21:29.480 --> 21:31.410
Why do you invite just anyone home?

436
21:31.480 --> 21:32.320
What are you talking about?

437
21:32.320 --> 21:33.200
My name is on the deed.

438
21:33.200 --> 21:34.680
Can't I invite guests?

439
21:35.120 --> 21:36.980
Hurry up and get ready for dinner.

440
21:39.480 --> 21:40.880
Who told you to touch my things?

441
21:40.880 --> 21:42.480
Keep your hands to yourself.

442
21:42.960 --> 21:44.560
You still kept the big sword.

443
21:45.880 --> 21:47.000
I threw it away.

444
21:47.720 --> 21:49.680
But my dad picked it back up.

445
21:54.040 --> 21:55.520
Because of one case,

446
21:56.080 --> 21:57.560
you got suspended for so long.

447
21:57.560 --> 21:58.440
Was it worth it?

448
22:01.080 --> 22:02.040
Pretty worth it.

449
22:02.560 --> 22:05.120
Yu Huihui's sentence was reduced from five years to two.

450
22:05.120 --> 22:06.680
And Zhou Huan got six years.

451
22:06.680 --> 22:07.940
It's totally worth it.

452
22:08.080 --> 22:09.800
If you don't change your temper,

453
22:09.800 --> 22:12.330
your license will be revoked sooner or later.

454
22:12.520 --> 22:14.380
Stop worrying about my business.

455
22:16.480 --> 22:17.810
Don't let it slip later.

456
22:18.080 --> 22:19.280
Keep your mouth shut.

457
22:19.480 --> 22:21.010
Don't spill it everywhere.

458
22:22.240 --> 22:23.570
Here, I'll do it myself.

459
22:26.960 --> 22:27.920
Not too much.

460
22:40.000 --> 22:40.720
Your Uncle Xiao

461
22:40.720 --> 22:42.580
organized this gathering today.

462
22:43.000 --> 22:44.520
He mainly...

463
22:47.000 --> 22:49.000
mainly to celebrate my

464
22:49.920 --> 22:52.380
glorious retirement of exactly ten months.

465
22:53.640 --> 22:54.880
Come on.

466
22:58.720 --> 22:59.960
Speaking of his retirement,

467
22:59.960 --> 23:01.680
it reminds me of when I was young.

468
23:01.680 --> 23:02.880
I never thought that one day

469
23:02.880 --> 23:06.240
I could sit at the same table with Director Li...

470
23:06.240 --> 23:07.000
Deputy.

471
23:07.480 --> 23:08.480
Deputy Director Li,

472
23:08.480 --> 23:11.000
to celebrate his retirement.

473
23:11.440 --> 23:12.240
Ten months.

474
23:12.320 --> 23:13.320
What does this show?

475
23:13.320 --> 23:16.240
It shows that there's no hurdle you can't get over.

476
23:16.840 --> 23:17.920
What's a big deal?

477
23:18.480 --> 23:19.960
What's a big conflict?

478
23:24.360 --> 23:26.240
No, your dad means

479
23:26.240 --> 23:27.720
our relationship used to be like that,

480
23:27.720 --> 23:30.240
just like cat and mouse.

481
23:30.400 --> 23:33.060
And now we can shake hands and make peace, right?

482
23:34.720 --> 23:35.240
Yes.

483
23:35.240 --> 23:35.880
Right?

484
23:37.880 --> 23:38.720
You...

485
23:39.000 --> 23:39.930
What you said...

486
23:39.960 --> 23:41.720
Although your analogy is not very appropriate,

487
23:41.720 --> 23:42.880
it makes sense.

488
23:43.240 --> 23:44.560
What do you think, Xiaolong?

489
23:44.560 --> 23:45.480
I say,

490
23:46.280 --> 23:47.960
who are you talking about?

491
23:49.520 --> 23:50.480
What is this?

492
23:50.480 --> 23:51.920
I get it.

493
23:51.920 --> 23:53.640
Hurry up and apologize to Xiaolong.

494
23:53.640 --> 23:55.240
No need to apologize.

495
23:55.480 --> 23:57.010
I understand what you mean.

496
23:57.480 --> 23:58.240
But,

497
23:59.720 --> 24:00.560
he and I

498
24:00.560 --> 24:02.000
walk different paths.

499
24:02.080 --> 24:03.760
No, why are you still talking about paths?

500
24:03.760 --> 24:04.480
Xiaolong,

501
24:04.480 --> 24:06.320
you know him well.

502
24:06.560 --> 24:08.800
I mean our backgrounds are different,

503
24:08.800 --> 24:10.480
and we have differences in principle.

504
24:10.480 --> 24:12.240
Xiaolong is not wrong.

505
24:12.480 --> 24:15.240
The basic thing about being a person is having a sense of right and wrong.

506
24:15.240 --> 24:17.440
You can't change your moral bottom line.

507
24:17.440 --> 24:18.440
Not even a little bit.

508
24:18.440 --> 24:19.200
Look at what Dad Li said.

509
24:19.200 --> 24:21.400
No, you just shouldn't take some cases.

510
24:23.480 --> 24:24.240
You're coughing so much.

511
24:24.240 --> 24:26.200
Should I go buy you some medicine?

512
24:26.200 --> 24:27.800
You shouldn't even be sitting here.

513
24:27.800 --> 24:29.860
You forgot your original intention.

514
24:30.560 --> 24:33.480
Didn't you two play well together when you were kids?

515
24:33.480 --> 24:34.160
Play well?

516
24:34.160 --> 24:36.240
Didn't we fight the first time we met?

517
24:36.240 --> 24:38.000
Isn't that how friendships start?

518
24:38.000 --> 24:38.680
When was this?

519
24:38.680 --> 24:39.480
Why don't I know?

520
24:39.480 --> 24:40.720
How would you know?

521
24:41.240 --> 24:41.720
At that time,

522
24:41.720 --> 24:43.040
you were in prison.

523
24:43.040 --> 24:43.920
Where were you?

524
24:46.040 --> 24:49.480
I mean when Xiaolong came to the police station to find her dad,

525
24:49.480 --> 24:51.440
I saw this little girl,

526
24:51.720 --> 24:54.720
with big eyes and cute braids.

527
24:54.800 --> 24:56.480
If I had a daughter like that,

528
24:56.560 --> 24:58.560
I would never let her end up like this.

529
24:58.560 --> 25:00.000
Today is such a happy occasion.

530
25:00.000 --> 25:02.320
Why are you talking about this?

531
25:02.760 --> 25:04.220
Didn't you ask me to say it?

532
25:04.880 --> 25:05.440
No.

533
25:05.440 --> 25:06.760
Don't you know what to say

534
25:06.760 --> 25:08.240
and what not to say?

535
25:09.680 --> 25:11.960
Do you have any emotional intelligence?

536
25:12.800 --> 25:14.680
Okay, I'll propose a toast.

537
25:14.960 --> 25:16.760
Dad Li, Dad,

538
25:16.960 --> 25:17.960
I'll drink first.

539
25:18.000 --> 25:19.040
Take small sips.

540
25:19.040 --> 25:20.480
You child, let me pour you some.

541
25:20.480 --> 25:22.280
Stop, I'll just drink this much.

542
25:23.400 --> 25:24.320
Thank you both.

543
25:25.000 --> 25:26.240
For preparing this meal,

544
25:26.240 --> 25:27.600
you've gone to a lot of trouble.

545
25:27.600 --> 25:30.440
I don't want us to fail to make peace

546
25:30.440 --> 25:32.170
and have you two split up again.

547
25:32.240 --> 25:34.160
Anyway, Li Xin and I...

548
25:34.720 --> 25:37.160
From now on, we go our separate ways.

549
25:37.400 --> 25:38.560
Enjoy your meal.

550
25:38.560 --> 25:39.240
Don't... You...

551
25:39.240 --> 25:39.680
I'm going back.

552
25:39.680 --> 25:40.880
Come have some more to drink. Come on.

553
25:40.880 --> 25:41.320
You...

554
25:46.240 --> 25:47.160
She's just like that.

555
25:47.160 --> 25:48.760
Xiaoxin, come, let's drink.

556
25:49.680 --> 25:50.740
Come, let's drink.

557
25:50.800 --> 25:52.440
Godfather, Dad.

558
25:53.000 --> 25:54.400
I actually have something to do.

559
25:54.400 --> 25:55.640
I... I'll get going. Actually,

560
25:55.640 --> 25:56.520
I'll drink water instead of wine.

561
25:56.520 --> 25:57.580
What are you doing?

562
25:57.640 --> 25:58.240
You...

563
26:02.920 --> 26:03.960
You haven't even...

564
26:03.960 --> 26:04.820
Take your time.

565
26:05.200 --> 26:06.240
Wait, you haven't even eaten anything.

566
26:06.240 --> 26:07.040
You...

567
26:11.440 --> 26:13.480
These kids, honestly...

568
26:14.200 --> 26:14.720
This...

569
26:14.720 --> 26:15.780
Wait, today you...

570
26:16.880 --> 26:18.680
Are we still drinking this wine?

571
27:07.240 --> 27:08.900
Why did you call me down again?

572
27:13.240 --> 27:16.480
What are you going to do during your suspension?

573
27:18.400 --> 27:20.160
I have a friend

574
27:21.120 --> 27:22.680
who does bar exam training.

575
27:23.400 --> 27:24.680
If you have nothing to do recently,

576
27:24.680 --> 27:26.340
you can help out as a lecturer.

577
27:26.480 --> 27:28.340
If you don't have enough money...

578
27:29.440 --> 27:31.480
Stop worrying about my business.

579
27:33.600 --> 27:36.080
I'm just doing this as a friend.

580
27:36.080 --> 27:36.720
Friend?

581
27:37.360 --> 27:38.960
We are no longer friends.

582
27:40.000 --> 27:42.060
Why are you so desperate for friends?

583
27:43.680 --> 27:44.400
Let's go.

584
27:45.560 --> 27:46.040
Que.

585
27:51.440 --> 27:52.640
Since I was a child,

586
27:54.480 --> 27:56.010
you've been my only friend.

587
28:00.480 --> 28:01.720
You are mighty, young hero.

588
28:01.720 --> 28:03.240
I am Xiao Longnü.

589
28:03.240 --> 28:05.400
May I know your name?

590
28:05.480 --> 28:06.720
I am Li Xin.

591
28:07.040 --> 28:09.320
Meeting by chance is fate.

592
28:09.840 --> 28:12.720
From today on, we are friends.

593
28:37.400 --> 28:38.000
All right.

594
28:40.000 --> 28:41.800
Let the past be the past.

595
28:45.920 --> 28:47.780
If you still consider me a friend,

596
28:48.680 --> 28:51.000
I hope you can respect my choice.

597
28:51.880 --> 28:54.440
I never lost to you when we were in Honghu,

598
28:54.920 --> 28:55.480
did I?

599
28:55.960 --> 28:57.400
Now that I'm out,

600
28:57.400 --> 28:59.000
I will definitely go all out.

601
28:59.200 --> 29:01.640
I really don't want to win too easily.

602
29:04.280 --> 29:05.000
Okay.

603
29:06.280 --> 29:08.000
If we meet in court,

604
29:08.920 --> 29:10.320
I will show no mercy.

605
29:28.400 --> 29:29.840
Mr. Liu, slow down.

606
29:30.000 --> 29:30.730
Are you okay?

607
29:31.040 --> 29:32.680
I'll go open the door.

608
29:32.760 --> 29:33.360
Slow down.

609
29:33.480 --> 29:34.880
How do I open the car door?

610
29:35.560 --> 29:36.090
Let's go.

611
29:36.120 --> 29:36.780
Have a seat.

612
29:37.800 --> 29:40.240
Mr. Liu, so we have a deal.

613
29:40.600 --> 29:41.720
When my suspension is over,

614
29:41.720 --> 29:43.760
can you give me a chance, Mr. Liu?

615
29:46.400 --> 29:47.080
Straightforward.

616
29:47.080 --> 29:47.560
Okay.

617
29:51.080 --> 29:52.560
Mr. Liu can't handle it either.

618
29:52.560 --> 29:54.080
Yeah.

619
29:54.480 --> 29:56.880
I bet he won't remember anything tomorrow.

620
29:57.480 --> 29:58.920
Then the money was wasted.

621
29:58.920 --> 29:59.160
Then your money wasn't wasted.

622
29:59.160 --> 30:01.280
Then your money wasn't wasted.

623
30:03.000 --> 30:03.730
Are you okay?

624
30:04.200 --> 30:05.730
What could be wrong with me?

625
30:06.480 --> 30:07.720
No, you...

626
30:10.920 --> 30:12.000
You can't hold it anymore.

627
30:12.000 --> 30:12.920
No, sis.

628
30:13.640 --> 30:16.100
I'll get you some tissues. No, no, no, water.

629
30:17.560 --> 30:19.490
Drink some honey water to sober up.

630
30:25.280 --> 30:26.920
Drink slowly.

631
30:29.920 --> 30:30.850
Feeling better?

632
30:32.200 --> 30:32.960
No.

633
30:33.200 --> 30:35.260
Look at you after drinking this much.

634
30:35.320 --> 30:36.000
Here.

635
30:36.480 --> 30:37.680
This month's salary.

636
30:38.680 --> 30:40.520
No. I didn't do anything this month.

637
30:40.520 --> 30:41.480
Our law firm hasn't had any business.

638
30:41.480 --> 30:42.280
Why would I need a salary?

639
30:42.280 --> 30:43.240
What do you mean, no?

640
30:43.240 --> 30:44.400
Just take it when I give it to you.

641
30:44.400 --> 30:45.480
Don't argue with me.

642
30:45.480 --> 30:46.360
You and... you and...

643
30:46.360 --> 30:48.280
Don't make your parents worry.

644
30:51.720 --> 30:53.280
It's still my fault, really.

645
30:53.280 --> 30:54.440
I dragged you down.

646
30:54.440 --> 30:57.160
What do you mean dragged me down? It's nothing.

647
30:58.200 --> 31:00.760
There's something I've always wondered about.

648
31:00.760 --> 31:03.040
You were working at Honghu,

649
31:03.400 --> 31:05.040
stable and respectable.

650
31:05.200 --> 31:06.960
Why did you insist on coming out to work with me,

651
31:06.960 --> 31:08.620
facing all this uncertainty?

652
31:09.720 --> 31:10.320
Sis,

653
31:11.080 --> 31:12.960
do you remember how we met?

654
31:17.080 --> 31:20.200
I had just joined Honghu back then.

655
31:21.000 --> 31:22.330
Good morning, Mr. Wang.

656
31:22.960 --> 31:24.720
Hot latte, Tao.

657
31:24.880 --> 31:25.480
Thank you.

658
31:26.520 --> 31:27.450
Iced Americano.

659
31:27.480 --> 31:28.560
Here are your documents.

660
31:28.560 --> 31:30.820
I'll bring you the second version later.

661
31:30.880 --> 31:31.600
Hey, you.

662
31:32.120 --> 31:33.760
Go downstairs and get a package for me.

663
31:33.760 --> 31:35.000
Okay, right now.

664
31:39.840 --> 31:40.680
Hey, you.

665
31:41.080 --> 31:43.340
Wipe the whiteboard in the meeting room.

666
31:45.040 --> 31:48.440
At that time, I was used to being a nobody,

667
31:48.520 --> 31:51.720
a little beast of burden without even a name.

668
31:58.520 --> 32:00.680
The client has been sitting in the meeting room for a long time.

669
32:00.680 --> 32:03.080
They don't even have a glass of water, and you're sleeping here.

670
32:03.080 --> 32:04.040
I'm sorry.

671
32:04.760 --> 32:06.000
I'll go get some now.

672
32:06.000 --> 32:08.200
No need. I've already taken the scolding for you.

673
32:08.200 --> 32:10.000
You don't need to come tomorrow.

674
32:37.720 --> 32:38.520
Gu Miaomiao.

675
32:44.720 --> 32:45.600
What's wrong?

676
32:46.040 --> 32:48.280
That day you called out my name

677
32:48.720 --> 32:50.720
and stood up for me.

678
32:50.720 --> 32:51.360
Attorney Xiao.

679
32:51.360 --> 32:54.000
Why does your department fire people just like that now?

680
32:54.000 --> 32:54.480
What's wrong?

681
32:54.480 --> 32:56.320
Look at Gu Miaomiao's attendance.

682
32:56.320 --> 32:58.000
She comes more often than you do.

683
32:58.000 --> 32:59.040
At least we are

684
32:59.040 --> 33:00.360
Honghu's HR.

685
33:00.360 --> 33:02.160
You should review the labor law.

686
33:02.920 --> 33:05.040
It was the first time I felt seen.

687
33:10.120 --> 33:12.000
What do you mean by being seen?

688
33:12.280 --> 33:14.360
Those who can't see you are blind.

689
33:14.560 --> 33:15.360
What invisible person?

690
33:15.360 --> 33:16.360
Remember this.

691
33:16.720 --> 33:18.360
No one is invisible.

692
33:18.480 --> 33:21.040
We are all the main characters of our own lives.

693
33:21.040 --> 33:21.800
Understand?

694
33:21.800 --> 33:22.600
Understood.

695
33:24.520 --> 33:27.040
To me, you are really amazing.

696
33:27.200 --> 33:29.680
You'd go through fire and water.

697
33:30.840 --> 33:33.480
Anyway, I will support you in whatever you do.

698
33:33.480 --> 33:35.280
To me, you are the best.

699
33:37.600 --> 33:38.520
Thank you.

700
33:42.040 --> 33:45.040
Let's try to take on a few major cases

701
33:45.240 --> 33:47.570
and make our law firm bigger and stronger.

702
33:47.680 --> 33:51.210
From now on, you'll be the administrative director of our firm.

703
33:52.600 --> 33:53.600
Director Miao.

704
33:54.040 --> 33:55.000
Director Miao.

705
33:57.560 --> 33:59.240
I'll change my contact name right now.

706
33:59.240 --> 34:01.360
I'll change it to Director-in-waiting.

707
34:01.360 --> 34:03.020
Okay, Director-in-waiting.

708
34:05.360 --> 34:06.760
It's almost twelve o'clock.

709
34:06.760 --> 34:07.520
Hurry, hurry.

710
34:07.520 --> 34:08.520
I can't drink anymore.

711
34:08.520 --> 34:09.040
No, no.

712
34:09.040 --> 34:10.280
I really can't drink anymore.

713
34:10.280 --> 34:12.280
Just come with me. Hurry up.

714
34:12.280 --> 34:12.960
Where are we going?

715
34:12.960 --> 34:14.199
Hurry up.

716
34:14.199 --> 34:14.730
Let's go.

717
34:17.920 --> 34:19.050
Run a little faster.

718
34:27.120 --> 34:27.719
Sis.

719
34:28.080 --> 34:30.280
Today is the last day of our suspension.

720
34:31.440 --> 34:32.080
Look.

721
34:32.880 --> 34:43.080
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five, four, three, two, one.

722
34:45.320 --> 34:48.320
Xiao Longnv Law Firm is reopening.

723
34:48.480 --> 34:52.880
Congratulations on the opening.

724
34:56.239 --> 34:57.800
A fresh start.

725
35:01.240 --> 35:02.240
We'll be fine.

726
35:02.240 --> 35:03.240
Trust me.

727
35:04.000 --> 35:05.000
Definitely.

728
35:06.000 --> 35:08.880
RISING JUSTICE.

729
35:14.400 --> 35:15.330
What's going on?

730
35:45.560 --> 35:46.080
Come in.

731
35:47.080 --> 35:47.960
Mr. Li.

732
35:48.600 --> 35:50.760
Here are the resumes of the intern lawyers to be interviewed today.

733
35:50.760 --> 35:51.320
Please take a look.

734
35:51.320 --> 35:51.680
Okay.

735
35:55.960 --> 35:56.560
Mr. Li.

736
35:56.880 --> 35:58.080
The first one is Wang Ruoqi.

737
35:58.080 --> 35:59.610
She is our boss's daughter.

738
36:01.000 --> 36:02.040
What do you think?

739
36:04.080 --> 36:05.040
I got it.

740
36:05.560 --> 36:06.440
Okay, Mr. Li.

741
36:06.440 --> 36:08.840
I won't bother you. Go ahead with your work.

742
36:11.880 --> 36:14.040
Hello, lawyers. I am Wang Ruoqi.

743
36:14.120 --> 36:15.840
I graduated from Xiangjiang University.

744
36:15.840 --> 36:17.120
My major is Chinese law.

745
36:17.120 --> 36:18.840
I have passed the bar exam.

746
36:19.160 --> 36:20.960
It's an honor to study at Honghu.

747
36:21.200 --> 36:23.260
An outstanding graduate of Jiangda.

748
36:25.000 --> 36:26.680
Mr. Li, she's your junior.

749
36:28.040 --> 36:28.560
Your GPA

750
36:28.560 --> 36:29.400
is quite good.

751
36:29.600 --> 36:30.120
Why is your PCLL

752
36:30.120 --> 36:31.000
so low?

753
36:31.800 --> 36:34.000
That's why I came to Honghu for an internship.

754
36:34.000 --> 36:35.760
I still want to get more practical experience

755
36:35.760 --> 36:37.320
to make up for my shortcomings as soon as possible.

756
36:37.320 --> 36:38.000
Ruoqi.

757
36:39.000 --> 36:41.360
I see your grades in corporate law

758
36:41.360 --> 36:42.760
are quite good.

759
36:43.400 --> 36:45.120
Then come to our team.

760
36:45.760 --> 36:46.920
Sorry, Mr. Shen.

761
36:47.680 --> 36:50.280
I want to join Mr. Li's team.

762
36:50.840 --> 36:52.120
Last time, I had the honor of hearing

763
36:52.120 --> 36:53.600
Mr. Li's closing argument in court.

764
36:53.600 --> 36:55.280
I thought it was absolutely brilliant.

765
36:55.280 --> 36:56.280
Look, look, look.

766
36:56.280 --> 36:58.810
Ruoqi has such high emotional intelligence.

767
36:59.400 --> 37:01.520
But I have a question for Lawyer Li.

768
37:04.000 --> 37:05.040
The offer from Juncheng in Hong Kong

769
37:05.040 --> 37:05.520
is notoriously

770
37:05.520 --> 37:07.160
hard to get.

771
37:07.520 --> 37:09.760
Why did you give it up after getting it

772
37:09.760 --> 37:11.360
and choose to come to Honghu?

773
37:14.280 --> 37:15.040
Is the offer from Honghu

774
37:15.040 --> 37:16.000
easy to get?

775
37:18.440 --> 37:20.920
There is a probation period for the intern lawyers I train.

776
37:20.920 --> 37:23.320
You can only stay officially if you pass it.

777
37:23.360 --> 37:26.000
No problem. I love challenges.

778
37:31.600 --> 37:32.440
What is this?

779
37:32.760 --> 37:35.090
Sister, step over it to get rid of bad luck.

780
37:35.280 --> 37:35.880
Miao.

781
37:35.880 --> 37:37.880
We shouldn't be so superstitious.

782
37:39.280 --> 37:40.610
Left foot or right foot?

783
37:40.680 --> 37:41.360
Left foot.

784
37:41.360 --> 37:42.040
Left foot.

785
37:42.040 --> 37:43.280
Come, hold this for a second.

786
37:43.280 --> 37:44.280
Let me get ready.

787
37:44.440 --> 37:44.760
Slow down.

788
37:44.760 --> 37:46.000
One, two, three, go.

789
37:47.400 --> 37:49.520
Safe landing, good luck.

790
37:50.000 --> 37:50.880
Taking off.

791
37:51.040 --> 37:52.500
Quite a sense of ceremony.

792
37:55.920 --> 37:56.760
What's wrong?

793
37:56.920 --> 37:58.050
Did you sleep wrong?

794
37:59.480 --> 38:00.480
Very flexible.

795
38:00.480 --> 38:01.760
What do you want to do?

796
38:02.200 --> 38:04.280
I believed your nonsense before

797
38:04.360 --> 38:05.560
and went undercover.

798
38:05.680 --> 38:08.400
As a result, my family's 200,000 yuan went down the drain.

799
38:08.400 --> 38:10.040
Shouldn't I settle this score with you?

800
38:10.040 --> 38:10.920
Dong Beihu.

801
38:10.920 --> 38:12.280
Don't act like a rogue in our law firm.

802
38:12.280 --> 38:13.920
I'll record you for evidence.

803
38:13.920 --> 38:15.450
How do you want to settle it?

804
38:17.160 --> 38:18.160
How?

805
38:22.640 --> 38:24.500
Then give me half of this law firm.

806
38:25.080 --> 38:27.880
Mr. Dong, do you want to cut it horizontally or vertically?

807
38:27.880 --> 38:29.680
I mean give me half of the shares.

808
38:29.760 --> 38:31.280
You definitely can't afford to pay me back.

809
38:31.280 --> 38:32.800
Let's just say that 200,000 yuan is my investment.

810
38:32.800 --> 38:35.200
Your abacus beads are practically hitting my face.

811
38:35.200 --> 38:36.000
You do nothing,

812
38:36.000 --> 38:37.080
and I work for you?

813
38:37.080 --> 38:38.640
What do you mean I did nothing?

814
38:38.640 --> 38:40.000
If it weren't for me in your last case,

815
38:40.000 --> 38:41.460
could you have succeeded?

816
38:42.440 --> 38:45.570
Okay, I admit you deserve credit for catching Zhou Huan.

817
38:46.400 --> 38:47.840
How about this?

818
38:48.400 --> 38:49.000
I happen to have

819
38:49.000 --> 38:51.080
an open position here.

820
38:51.200 --> 38:52.280
Think about it.

821
38:52.360 --> 38:53.280
What position?

822
38:53.960 --> 38:55.290
Marketing Specialist.

823
38:55.560 --> 38:57.360
How big is this place to have a whole department?

824
38:57.360 --> 38:58.160
Weren't you also

825
38:58.160 --> 38:59.520
a middleman for cases before?

826
38:59.520 --> 39:00.520
What do you mean by middleman?

827
39:00.520 --> 39:02.200
That was legal service consulting.

828
39:02.200 --> 39:04.320
You can call it a superpower if you want.

829
39:04.320 --> 39:05.960
Anyway, that's how it is.

830
39:05.960 --> 39:07.720
You need money, and I need cases.

831
39:07.720 --> 39:09.640
You can just work for me steadily

832
39:09.640 --> 39:12.000
and get paid by performance. How about it?

833
39:13.360 --> 39:15.760
If you put it that way, it's not impossible.

834
39:16.000 --> 39:17.280
Then when a case is successful in the future,

835
39:17.280 --> 39:17.960
we split it fifty-fifty.

836
39:17.960 --> 39:18.920
Fifty-fifty?

837
39:19.160 --> 39:20.560
Do you know how long it takes me to handle a case?

838
39:20.560 --> 39:21.440
And you want fifty-fifty?

839
39:21.440 --> 39:22.000
Eighty-twenty.

840
39:22.000 --> 39:23.120
Eighty for me, twenty for you.

841
39:23.120 --> 39:23.920
You're crazy.

842
39:24.440 --> 39:25.640
Do you think it's easy for me to bring in a case?

843
39:25.640 --> 39:26.400
Sixty-forty.

844
39:26.400 --> 39:28.000
Do you think it's easy for me to fight a lawsuit? Eighty-twenty.

845
39:28.000 --> 39:29.520
Twenty sounds bad. Seventy-thirty.

846
39:29.520 --> 39:31.080
If you're going to talk like this, it's no fun.

847
39:31.080 --> 39:31.960
You're not sincere at all.

848
39:31.960 --> 39:33.000
You're the one who's not sincere.

849
39:33.000 --> 39:34.000
If you talk like this, I'm leaving.

850
39:34.000 --> 39:34.760
Go ahead.

851
39:34.760 --> 39:35.490
I'm leaving.

852
39:35.840 --> 39:36.600
Don't call me back.

853
39:36.600 --> 39:38.130
Who are you trying to scare?

854
39:38.320 --> 39:39.400
I'm really leaving.

855
39:39.400 --> 39:41.240
Go. The door is over there. Hurry up.

856
39:41.240 --> 39:42.300
Don't call me back.

857
39:46.320 --> 39:47.360
You're quite persistent.

858
39:47.360 --> 39:48.160
I appreciate that.

859
39:48.160 --> 39:49.000
Honestly.

860
39:49.280 --> 39:50.280
Let's sign the contract.

861
39:50.280 --> 39:51.080
What contract?

862
39:51.080 --> 39:52.000
This is a legitimate law firm.

863
39:52.000 --> 39:53.000
There's a probation period.

864
39:53.000 --> 39:54.480
Bring in a case first.

865
39:56.440 --> 39:57.480
Okay, it's a deal.

866
39:58.080 --> 40:01.410
You two will get a discount when you go downstairs for a bath.

867
40:02.240 --> 40:03.370
Should we thank you?

868
40:03.480 --> 40:04.480
For the discount.

869
40:05.600 --> 40:06.360
Sis.

870
40:07.680 --> 40:10.760
If he really brings in a case, are we really going to use him?

871
40:10.760 --> 40:11.920
We'll cross that bridge when we come to it.

872
40:11.920 --> 40:14.320
Life is full of surprises. Who knows?

873
40:15.200 --> 40:16.520
Good citizen.

874
40:17.800 --> 40:18.960
Good citizen.

875
40:18.960 --> 40:20.690
Alright, alright, put it away.

876
40:20.840 --> 40:23.280
See that? Our status is different now.

877
40:24.200 --> 40:25.960
Not only am I a good citizen,

878
40:26.440 --> 40:29.480
I've also been successfully promoted from the boss of a legal consulting firm

879
40:29.480 --> 40:32.400
to the marketing director of a law firm.

880
40:33.040 --> 40:34.160
That's not right, bro.

881
40:34.160 --> 40:35.200
Why does it sound like

882
40:35.200 --> 40:36.640
you got demoted instead of promoted?

883
40:36.640 --> 40:37.800
Shut up.

884
40:38.040 --> 40:39.520
Do you know what a law firm is?

885
40:39.520 --> 40:41.880
A law firm means having lawyers.

886
40:41.880 --> 40:43.680
Once we integrate these resources,

887
40:43.680 --> 40:45.960
all services will be a one-stop shop.

888
40:46.040 --> 40:47.080
So from now on,

889
40:47.200 --> 40:49.080
whether it's a big case or a small case,

890
40:49.080 --> 40:50.080
a major case or a crucial case,

891
40:50.080 --> 40:52.360
as long as you have a case, push it to me.

892
40:52.360 --> 40:53.080
Got it?

893
40:53.080 --> 40:54.080
Got it, got it.

894
40:54.200 --> 40:56.330
If you're in trouble, go to Brother Hu.

895
40:56.600 --> 40:57.120
Go to Brother Hu.

896
40:57.120 --> 40:58.400
Come, come, come.

897
41:06.320 --> 41:07.640
Ma'am, this is my business card.

898
41:07.640 --> 41:08.520
Here you go.

899
41:08.720 --> 41:10.200
Ask around on this street.

900
41:10.200 --> 41:12.040
Everyone knows what I'm capable of.

901
41:12.040 --> 41:13.880
There's no lawsuit I can't win.

902
41:15.840 --> 41:16.360
Ma'am, ma'am.

903
41:16.360 --> 41:17.600
No, cases like yours,

904
41:17.600 --> 41:18.600
I've handled so many.

905
41:18.600 --> 41:19.920
It's a piece of cake, really.

906
41:19.920 --> 41:21.980
Just tell me if you have any concerns.

907
41:22.160 --> 41:23.040
Understood, understood.

908
41:23.040 --> 41:23.960
It's about the price, right? Hey!

909
41:23.960 --> 41:24.880
The price is negotiable.

910
41:24.880 --> 41:25.920
No need. Look, ma'am.

911
41:25.920 --> 41:26.720
You even sent a pennant.

912
41:26.720 --> 41:28.080
No win, no fee, okay?

913
41:28.120 --> 41:30.050
I'll get angry if you do this again.

914
41:30.480 --> 41:30.720
Take care.

915
41:30.720 --> 41:32.250
It's really not necessary.

916
41:32.400 --> 41:33.440
Didn't I just

917
41:33.520 --> 41:36.080
bravely break into a criminal gang alone

918
41:36.080 --> 41:37.920
and save a group of elderly people?

919
41:37.920 --> 41:39.400
I would've forgotten if you hadn't mentioned it.

920
41:39.400 --> 41:41.200
This is what our Xiaolongnü Law Firm

921
41:41.200 --> 41:42.200
is supposed to do.

922
41:42.400 --> 41:44.920
Yes, our firm can handle any lawsuit.

923
41:45.360 --> 41:47.120
Lawyer Xiao is definitely the light of the city,

924
41:47.120 --> 41:48.800
the embodiment of justice, the nemesis of evil,

925
41:48.800 --> 41:50.640
and she especially helps the elderly.

926
41:50.640 --> 41:52.160
Okay, alright, alright.

927
41:52.160 --> 41:53.420
I won't thank you here.

928
41:53.520 --> 41:54.520
You're too kind.

929
41:55.520 --> 41:57.720
Ma'am, is there anything I can help you with?

930
41:57.720 --> 41:58.680
Young man.

931
41:59.440 --> 42:00.960
Someone owes me money.

932
42:01.240 --> 42:02.570
How much do they owe you?

933
42:11.360 --> 42:12.890
Pack up, let's get off work.

934
42:17.160 --> 42:18.520
Did you drive in?

935
42:20.080 --> 42:20.920
Nobody leave.

936
42:21.320 --> 42:22.250
We got a big case.

937
42:22.400 --> 42:23.920
Let's work hard and do some overtime.

938
42:23.920 --> 42:25.320
Really?

939
42:25.320 --> 42:27.040
You actually got a big case after all this time?

940
42:27.040 --> 42:28.000
I'm surprised too.

941
42:28.000 --> 42:29.400
The case came right to me.

942
42:29.760 --> 42:31.520
Every profession produces its own top expert.

943
42:31.520 --> 42:33.560
What big case, top expert?

944
42:36.160 --> 42:37.160
Three people?

945
42:37.640 --> 42:39.000
Guess the amount.

946
42:39.160 --> 42:39.760
30,000?

947
42:40.640 --> 42:41.370
Guess again.

948
42:41.840 --> 42:43.320
300,000?

949
42:43.400 --> 42:44.360
Think bigger.

950
42:45.000 --> 42:46.920
3,000,000.

951
42:48.480 --> 42:50.680
Let's work overtime. I'll call them in.

952
42:52.000 --> 42:53.930
You brought the God of Wealth here.

953
42:55.120 --> 42:56.040
Welcome.
